{"data": [{"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-11-04T20:38:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118080567891615887"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ChorzempaMarti…", "end": 120, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ChorzempaMartin/status/2117995262375526706", "start": 97, "url": "https://t.co/pqHGCZhNCL"}]}, "id": "2118080567891615887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2498, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117995262375526706", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Seems like a sensible suggestion from Martin \n\n Refigerators work just fine with manual controls https://t.co/pqHGCZhNCL", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2118080567891615887"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-04T20:29:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118078248429228056"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Die Bundesregierung verschärft ihren Kurs gegen chinesische Netzwerkausrüster. Neue Sicherheitsvorgaben könnten einen Komplettausschluss von Huawei-Technologie aus dem 5G-Netz ermöglichen.", "display_url": "handelsblatt.com/politik/deutsc…", "end": 137, "expanded_url": "https://www.handelsblatt.com/politik/deutschland/mobilfunk-bundesregierung-bereitet-neue-huawei-verbote-vor/100265511.html", "images": [{"height": 1152, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117910348959248384/QRMDVjqh?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2048}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117910348959248384/QRMDVjqh?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 114, "status": 200, "title": "Mobilfunk: Bundesregierung bereitet neue Huawei-Verbote vor", "unwound_url": "https://www.handelsblatt.com/politik/deutschland/mobilfunk-bundesregierung-bereitet-neue-huawei-verbote-vor/100265511.html", "url": "https://t.co/A9OV0e6BnG"}]}, "id": "2118078248429228056", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 771, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "\"Germany is preparing a far-reaching ban on Chinese network technology- aka Huawei - from German mobile networks\"\nhttps://t.co/A9OV0e6BnG", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2118078248429228056"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-04T20:22:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118076338963648599"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Proposed Trade Act amendments would expand restrictions and double the maximum prison sentence for illegal exports, while experts question their deterrent effect", "display_url": "caixinglobal.com/2026-11-05/tai…", "end": 90, "expanded_url": "https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-11-05/taiwan-weighs-tighter-controls-on-chip-exports-to-chinese-mainland-102501072.html", "images": [{"height": 373, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118076340234543104/aYzpghdE?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 560}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118076340234543104/aYzpghdE?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 67, "status": 200, "title": "Taiwan Weighs Tighter Controls on Chip Exports to Chinese Mainland", "unwound_url": "https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-11-05/taiwan-weighs-tighter-controls-on-chip-exports-to-chinese-mainland-102501072.html", "url": "https://t.co/8AIFLGrWqQ"}]}, "id": "2118076338963648599", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 875, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Taiwan Weighs Tighter Controls on Chip Exports to Chinese Mainland\nhttps://t.co/8AIFLGrWqQ", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2118076338963648599"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-04T20:13:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118074110458871970"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 204, "start": 198, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/business/statu…", "end": 305, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/business/status/2117861934422708719", "start": 282, "url": "https://t.co/Ch0Z4R8PUR"}]}, "id": "2118074110458871970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1031, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117861934422708719", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "It was never possible for the company to ramp up supply fast enough to meet surging demand.\n\nIt is, &amp; always was, a zero sum game. Bc of limited production capacity, every advanced chip sold to #China means fewer going to 🇺🇲 firms that badly need them.\n\nGlad that's cleared up. https://t.co/Ch0Z4R8PUR", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2118074110458871970"}, {"author_id": "3039504459", "created_at": "2026-11-04T19:27:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118062487102714042"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Researchers have used radio observations of rapidly spinning neutron stars to search for signals from supermassive black hole pairs at the dawn of galaxy formation.", "display_url": "go.aps.org/4z1o4WG", "end": 272, "expanded_url": "https://go.aps.org/4z1o4WG", "images": [{"height": 200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118062492597239809/j_EYR-P-?format=png&name=orig", "width": 200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118062492597239809/j_EYR-P-?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 249, "status": 200, "title": "Nanohertz Gravitational-Wave Constraints on Supermassive Binary Black Holes at Cosmic Dawn", "unwound_url": "https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/5z5g-shly", "url": "https://t.co/48DQ2JBSvF"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Ex4OL8S8Pb", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2118062487102714042/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118062484422541312", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/Ex4OL8S8Pb"}]}, "id": "2118062487102714042", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 379, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Using Parkes Observatory data, researchers place the first direct limits on supermassive binary black holes at the cosmic dawn — establishing a practical framework for studying the evolution and formation of early-universe black holes.\n\nLearn more: https://t.co/48DQ2JBSvF https://t.co/Ex4OL8S8Pb", "url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2118062487102714042"}, {"author_id": "961132338", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:24:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118046841384390766"], "id": "2118046841384390766", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1339, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Must say that this Valkyries championship parade is perfectly timed", "url": "https://x.com/M_C_Klein/status/2118046841384390766"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:18:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118045322127835157"], "id": "2118045322127835157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1882, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "I wish I had good election takes about the labor market, but I don't.\n\nThe single biggest labor market question for 2027 is \"what happens to inflation, and what does the Fed do in response\" &amp; I don't yet have strong informed first-order opinions on how the election affects either", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2118045322127835157"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:14:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118044144031735813"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A Month of Catchup", "display_url": "substack.com/home/post/p-22…", "end": 221, "expanded_url": "https://substack.com/home/post/p-223242215", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118044145478717441/PGQLSUnc?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118044145478717441/PGQLSUnc?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 198, "status": 200, "title": "BLS Jobs Report Preview (October)", "unwound_url": "https://macromostly.substack.com/p/bls-jobs-report-preview-october-062", "url": "https://t.co/nSbmzkOgTJ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/tx2ue3u56o", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2118044144031735813/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118043948929449984", "start": 222, "url": "https://t.co/tx2ue3u56o"}]}, "id": "2118044144031735813", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1153, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "A preview of the most important data being released this week: the October jobs report.\n\nI think it's going to be a good one, mostly due to catch-up after September's disappointing softness.\n\nLink: https://t.co/nSbmzkOgTJ https://t.co/tx2ue3u56o", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2118044144031735813"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:04:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118041608985915640"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 104, "id": "255481647", "start": 94, "username": "linamkhan"}, {"end": 152, "id": "16963843", "start": 141, "username": "PabloTorre"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sZsd7uFgyd", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2118041608985915640/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118041480304459776", "start": 153, "url": "https://t.co/sZsd7uFgyd"}, {"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 200, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2118025481614176686", "start": 177, "url": "https://t.co/m6qdhBI9Qk"}]}, "id": "2118041608985915640", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 37118, "like_count": 574, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 15}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118025481614176686", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "There's more names to come, but among our speakers will be well-known open source AI advocate @linamkhan