"url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2118027358493917239"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:04:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118026644971807222"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IzsVyimQiv", "end": 140, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2118026644971807222/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118026404361072640", "start": 117, "url": "https://t.co/IzsVyimQiv"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IzsVyimQiv", "end": 140, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2118026644971807222/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118026599186456576", "start": 117, "url": "https://t.co/IzsVyimQiv"}]}, "id": "2118026644971807222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 29831, "like_count": 104, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Anthropic perps on Hyperliquid up about 5% today and 9.5% over the last 5 days. OpenAI down 1% over the same period. https://t.co/IzsVyimQiv", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2118026644971807222"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118025481614176686"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 91, "id": "20169416", "start": 78, "username": "tracyalloway"}], "urls": [{"description": "Wednesday, December 9, 2026 City Winery New York 25 11th Ave New York, NY 10011 Presented by On Wednesday December 9th, Tracy Alloway and Joe Weisenthal take the stage once again, bringing in top-tier guests for a live taping of the Odd Lots podcast. Come join us, listen to the podcast, and meet your fellow Odd Lots listeners. Hours: 5:30 Doors, 7:00 Show Tickets $75 Bloomberg's Joe Weisenthal and Tracy Alloway explore the most interesting topics in finance, markets and economics. Join the conversation", "display_url": "events.bloombergevents.com/event/OddLotsN…", "end": 256, "expanded_url": "https://events.bloombergevents.com/event/OddLotsNYC/summary", "start": 233, "status": 200, "title": "Home - Odd Lots Live